- **Table-driven**: all cases live in a single `tests` slice, making it trivial to add new cases later.
- **Subtests**: `t.Run(tc.name, ...)` ensures each failure reports which specific case failed (e.g., `--- FAIL: TestWordCount/mixed_case`).
